Fairbuds XL is designed with a focus on modularity, making it simple to disassemble and repair individual components. This extends its lifespan and helps to minimise electronic waste. Incorporating recycled materials highlights Fairphone's dedication to sustainability by reducing the need for new resources. With a focus on durability, Fairbuds XL are designed to withstand everyday use, promoting longevity compared to disposable electronics. In addition, Fairphone's supply chain practices prioritise ethics and transparency, reflecting their commitment to social and environmental responsibility. This aligns with their dedication to circular design. In general, Fairbuds XL showcase a strong commitment to circular design principles, with a focus on repairability, sustainability, and ethical sourcing throughout their lifecycle.